PRE-TABLE CHECK -- wdcaltdigin
Written BEFORE table 1 runs, so this file's own mtime proves the order.

THE DIFF UNDER TEST is in src/devices/dev_wdc.c:
  DEVICE_ACCESS(wdc_altstatus) at line 609:
    Ruled repair: decode relative_addr on the MEM_READ path:
      if (writeflag == MEM_READ) {
          if (relative_addr != 0) {
              odata = 0;
          } else {
              debug("[ wdc: read from ALTSTATUS: 0x%02x ]\n",
                  (int)odata);
          }
      } else if (relative_addr != 0) {
          /* existing #494 write-decline arm, unchanged */
      }
    Common tail assigns data[0] = odata on MEM_READ and returns 1.
    Declined read convention: emulator policy pre-zeroes registered-device
    read buffers (#95); returning 0 is an emulator convention, not a claim
    about physical ATA bus float.

--------------------------------------------------------------------- SIBLING PARITY

1. Sibling symmetry with #494:
   #494 repaired (WRITE, offset 1) in DEVICE_ACCESS(wdc_altstatus) to decline stores to
   the read-only Drive Address register (0x3f7) so they do not trigger a soft reset.
   The READ path remained un-decoded in the preceding `if (writeflag == MEM_READ)`,
   returning status byte S for both offset 0 (0x3f6) and offset 1 (0x3f7).
   wdcaltdigin completes the 4-cell table:
     - (WRITE, offset 0): Alt Ctrl (#481) -> soft reset
     - (WRITE, offset 1): Drive Address register (#494) -> declined store
     - (READ,  offset 0): Alt Status -> returns S (S != 0)
     - (READ,  offset 1): Drive Address register (wdcaltdigin) -> declined read (0x00)

--------------------------------------------------------------------- CLAIM -> ROW

1. "Offset-1 read at power-on returns 0x00 rather than status byte S (0x51)"
   -> ROWED as CORE_READ_OFF1_POWERON (fails pre-fix, passes post-fix).
2. "Offset-1 read while armed returns 0x00 rather than armed status S_armed (0x58)"
   -> ROWED as CORE_READ_OFF1_ARMED (fails pre-fix, passes post-fix).
3. "Legal offset-0 read returns non-zero status S at power-on (rejects null medium)"
   -> ROWED as ACCEPT_READ_OFF0_POWERON (want S = 0x51 != 0).
4. "Legal offset-0 read returns non-zero status S_armed while armed (rejects null medium)"
   -> ROWED as ACCEPT_READ_OFF0_ARMED (want S_armed = 0x58 != 0).
5. "Write cell offset 0 soft reset (#481) unregressed"
   -> ROWED as WRITE0_SRST_DRQ_CLEAR (0x50) and WRITE0_SRST_RING_PURGED (0xff).
6. "Write cell offset 1 write-decline (#494) unregressed"
   -> ROWED as WRITE1_DECLINE_DRQ_SET (0x58) and WRITE1_DECLINE_RING_INTACT (0x71).
7. "Liveness and Device Signature Controls"
   -> ROWED as CONTROL_RAM_LIVENESS (0x55), CONTROL_CYL_LO_LIVENESS (0x55),
      CONTROL_CYL_HI_LIVENESS (0x66), CONTROL_FIFO_DEVSIG_1 (0x5a),
      CONTROL_FIFO_DEVSIG_2 (0xa5), CONTROL_STATUS_POWERON (0x51),
      CONTROL_STATUS_ARMED (0x58), CONTROL_STATUS_ARMED_W2 (0x58).

