VACUOUS-BY-CONSTRUCTION CHECK: Every row above names a channel that CAN vary under its
named mutant. In particular, M_NULL_EFFECT varies ONLY on offset-1 reads and CANNOT be killed
if S == 0. Because our fixture measures S = 0x51 and S_armed = 0x58 (strictly non-zero),
the channel is guaranteed active and non-vacuous.

